UX saw the 61 gate slip once between the CTA and O3. Three parts:
- the vote hold starts at the press on the CTA (vote_open sees it);
- the finish grace: the frame the gate opens, a running ultimatum gets
  at least ultimatum.finishGraceSec (10 s) left, once per ultimatum;
- the finish line is quiet: no card that costs seats (brawl, pledge,
  seat drain, lost partner, Kaia) fires while the gate is open.
Bench: median-player gates that fell within 3 s: 3 of 72 -> 0 of 72.

Also G2 (UX review 2): content-lint checks every ticker no-break unit
(ux/mobile-first-layout.md §5.2.1 strong glue) fits the 280 px clip at
x4; the number-magnitude joint is weak, so "850.6 מיליארד ₪." passes
as the spec allows. Widest unit today 216 px.

